Ontario QSO Party -- the Ontario multipliers (counties, districts, regional municipalities and single-tier cities)
Loaded by an entrant outside Ontario; each entry is its own multiplier, and an Ontario entrant counts each too (no > On mapping).
Source: the sponsor's OQPMultList.pdf, Effective 01Jan2023 (http://www.va3cco.com/oqp/OQPMultList.pdf).
No INCLUDE here: the host-area rule reads this file as the host's QTHs and nothing else.
No line of this header may hold an equals sign: the reader takes any such line as an entry.

